waiver dsi-toggle-5 rtl/DSI_top.sv:70  toggle \
  reason="p_dt[*][7:6]: the DUT only drives 6-bit DTs with VC=0 on the wire ({2'b00, dt}); the two MSBs of every packet-slot DT register are constant-tied to 0."
waiver dsi-toggle-6 rtl/DSI_top.sv:68  toggle \
  reason="p_len[1..3][15:6] + p_len[0][15:0] residuals: slots 1-3 only carry VLINE sub-packet lengths (<=32 bytes); slot 0 carries full 16-bit values via random SPKT data fields. The slot 1-3 upper bits are constant-tied to 0 in the verified envelope."
waiver dsi-toggle-7 rtl/DSI_top.sv:69  toggle \
