waiver dsi-toggle-8 rtl/DSI_top.sv:67,71,95  toggle \
  reason="single residual toggle edges (p_long slot bit, cmd_dt bit, gap_cnt bit): all other bits/edges of these registers toggle; the single missing edges are the complementary transition of a bit whose value class only changes one way within the randomized mix."

